"occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T14:10:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706695450","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:11:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4943280-1846651706692558","game_id":"steam-4943280","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update – Xbox Controller Support, Driving & AI Improvements","summary":"A new update for the Federal Cadet demo is now available!This update brings major improvements to controller support, vehicle handling, NPC behavior, and traffic AI, alongside new police sirens, improved 4K interface support, and additional optimizations.🎮 Full Xbox Controller SupportThe demo now supports Xbox controllers throughout the entire gameplay experience, including:Character movement and camera controls.Interactions with the environment.Navigation through menus.Police tablet navigation.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T20:05:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706692558","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:11:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4943280-1846018067944389","game_id":"steam-4943280","kind":"update","title":"Federal Cadet Demo Update – Driving, AI & Community Feedback Improvements","summary":"Thank you to everyone who has played the Federal Cadet Demo and shared feedback with us.Since the demo launched, we’ve been working on several of the points raised by players. This update focuses mainly on vehicle handling, civilian AI and traffic behaviour, along with a number of smaller fixes and improvements.Vehicle Handling ImprovementsImproved vehicle collision handlingFixed situations where vehicles could become stuck against environmental objectsImproved the braking system and overall bra","occurred_at":null,"publish